# NAMESPACE is intentionally hand-maintained for this package.
#
# Most entries below are generated from roxygen2 @export/@importFrom tags in
# the authored R/ files. However, several S3 methods from the vendored
# cooperative engine (R/cooperative-*.R) are added here manually because
# those files are parity-locked and cannot receive @export tags:
#   S3method(coef,cv.multiview)   -- cooperative-cv.multiview.R:369
#   S3method(coef,multiview)      -- cooperative-multiview.R
#   S3method(family,cv.multiview) -- cooperative-family.multiview.R:16
#   S3method(family,multiview)    -- cooperative-family.multiview.R
#   S3method(plot,multiview)      -- cooperative-multiview.R:637
#   S3method(predict,cv.multiview)-- cooperative-predict.cv.multiview.R:57
#   S3method(predict,multiview)   -- cooperative-predict.multiview.R:60
#
# Running roxygen2::roxygenise() is safe: it skips this file (no magic
# "Generated by roxygen2" header), so the hand-maintained lines are preserved.
# To regen only man/ docs: roxygen2::roxygenise(roclets = "rd")
#
